    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton controller that tracks and broadcasts the active scaling mode. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Subscribes to ModelViewManager toggle events and raises modeChanged so other systems can react to mode switches. </para>
